Designed to last up to five years, the trial was stopped after less than two because endpoints set by an independent oversight committee were met, the study says.
Researchers found that participants taking Crestor cut their risk of heart attack, stroke and death by nearly half
Overall death in the Crestor group was 20 percent less than the placebo group.
