Without being a member, she was limited to six LPGA events, plus the U.S. Women's Open and Women's British Open.
"I play whenever I want now, not when I have to play, or only six tournaments," she said.
"I can pick and choose.
I might play two in a row, three in a row, and have some momentum.
I really like this game, and I want to play a lot.
I'm going to take advantage of this card."
