President George W. Bush has just announced an effort to ease airline delays during the holiday travel season starting next week.
Last year, the military opened some airspace to some commercial flights on the East Coast.
This year, the President says extra air lanes will be available in other parts of the country as well.
Officials say the biggest of the 3 major wildfires burning in southern California was not arson.
That fire has burned nearly 29,000 acres in Orange, Riverside, San Bernardino, and Los Angeles Counties.
