Tension has been escalating between the opposition party and the state prosecution over the ongoing investigation into Lee´s real estate deals.
The investigation was prompted by defamation suits filed by Lee´s brother-in-law, Kim Jae-jung, against aides of Lee´s GNP rival, Park Geun-hye, who claimed that Lee had owned land in his relatives´ names.
