Israel's attack on Lebanon will not resolve the problems, but will only lead to a vicious cycle of retaliation, they said in a statement.
The lawmakers denounced Israel, claiming Hezbollah's purpose in kidnapping Israeli soldiers, which sparked a series of indiscriminate attacks on Lebanon, was the release of some 8,000 Arabs being held in Israeli prisons, including some 400 children.
They urged the South Korean government to take part in international mediation efforts together with the United Nations to produce a peaceful resolution to the crisis.
