The 17-year-old went to a police station in the town of Aizuwakamatsu, north of Tokyo, carrying the head in a sports bag, Japanese media said.
The beheaded body of a woman was later found at the boy’s home.
This is the latest in a series of grisly killings in Japan, a country renowned for its alleged low crime rate.
