There was something in there.
I coughed up and a nail came up through my throat.
That is not a small nail.
Doctors say it may have been lodged in the nasal cavity for 30 years.
The magnetic force of the MRI somehow knocking it down.
Once it's in a nasal cavity like that, a little membrane forms around, and it just becomes a foreign body.
Sanchez says he has no idea how the nail got there, but it has people talking.
He's a medical miracle.
