The interest on certificates of deposit has been rapidly increasing as a result of the recent hike in the call rate.
This is raising the burden for household loans with floating rates.
Interest on mortgage loans worth 20 trillion won is 80 percent related to certificate of deposit rates.
The certificate of deposit rate closed at 4.03 percent Friday, unchanged from the previous session and contrary to forecasts of a correction following a recent surge in rates.
