The two lawyers shot on Tuesday were defending Saddam Hussein's half-brother Barzan Ibrahim al-Tikriti, and former Vice President Taha Yassin Ramadan.
A lawyer for one of Saddam Hussein's co-defendants has been shot to death in Baghdad while another has been injured.
