In a speech to US war veterans in Reno, Nevada, Bush renewed charges that Tehran has provided training and weapons for extremists in Iraq.
“The Iranian regime must halt these actions,” he demanded.
Earlier, Iranian President Mahmoud Ahmadinejad warned that US authority in the region was rapidly collapsing, and Iran would help fill the void.
