Breaking from its usually stern rhetoric, North Korea expressed condolences to the United States over the weekend for victims of a massive hurricane that has devastated the U.S.
North Korea’s Red Cross Society sent a message of sympathy to its U.S. counterpart saying it hoped the country would recover quickly from the natural disaster.
