Kim said the prosecutor in question, Baek Yong-ha, and other prosecutors in the chain of command at the Seoul Eastern District Prosecutors Office will be questioned.
“A rookie prosecutor was assigned to a serious case, and I will investigate whether he properly reported his actions,” Kim said.
