The Korea Times reports prosecutors summoned Lee Soon-ja , wife of former president Chun Doo-hwan, for questioning over his alleged secret funds on Tuesday afternoon.
The Supreme Public Prosecutor's Office said that Lee was questioned over the source of 13 billion won presumed to be part of Chun's undisclosed money.
