Kim Jin-sun, governor of Kangwon Province, to which PyeongChang belongs, told reporters during an intermission to the morning's presentation, ``Some of the delegation members said in the Q&A session that they were deeply impressed by PyeongChang's effort to make the 2014 Winter Olympics a time of peace and harmony.''
PyeongChang, competing with Salzburg, Austria, and Sochi, Russia, has been playing host to the delegation.
It is the first of the bidders to receive such a visit.
