Police arrested Steven Morgan outside a convenience store 10 miles away from the site of Wednesday's shooting at Wesleyan University.
New unemployment numbers are increasing expectations that an economic recovery could kick in before the end of the year.
Employers slowed the pace of layoffs, cutting 539,000 jobs last month;
that's the fewest in 6 months.
