Korea Savings Bank said it is soon going to offer an overseas real estate mortgage.
``We decided to offer the overseas real estate mortgage since there has been increasing demand for this type of product among our customers recently,’’ said an official of the bank.
Currently, those who wish to buy houses abroad have to rely on mortgages provided by financial institutions in the country where they will be making the investment since Korean financial firms have not taken overseas real estate as collateral for housing loans.
Such loans, however, were very expensive given that few Korean investors have credit records abroad.
