Many of those who turned out for Saturday’s protest carried national flags and placards.
The government claims that the channel is breaching the constitution by rallying support for the opposition.
Near the demonstration, hundreds of Chavez’s supporters wearing red caps and T-shirts staged a rival rally to express their support for the closure of RCTV, which has been broadcasting for 33 years.
