The Commerce Department reports the economy shrank at an annual rate of 3.8%;
Still, that's the worst showing for the Gross Domestic Product since the recession year of 1982.
And one economist says the economy got weaker as the 4th quarter rolled on.
Another economist sees things in a little brighter light:
