President Roh Moo-hyun and Chinese President Hu Jintao on Sunday called on North Korea to return to the six-party talks to discuss ways of resolving the escalating crisis over its nuclear weapons programs.
President Roh Moo-hyun and Chinese President Hu Jintao on Sunday called on North Korea to return to the six-party talks to discuss ways of resolving the escalating crisis over its nuclear weapons programs.
