˝North Korea has shut down all five nuclear facilities at its main Yongbyon complex, International Atomic Energy Agency head Mohamed ElBaradei said.
IAEA monitors in North Korea had verified the four new closures, ElBaradei told journalists in Malaysia.
North Korea shut down its sole working reactor at Yongbyon on Saturday.
